{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>For</b> — Because of this verse, many considered the prophecy to concern the future; perhaps it is so. And Rabbi Moses [ibn Janach] said: We find that the fear of HaShem fell upon all the nations surrounding Jerusalem in the days of Jehoshaphat, and they brought him tribute. And behold, in his days the captives returned in the days of their fathers."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "Rabbi Moses is resolved as ibn Janach by inference from the standard attribution pattern, though the reference could conceivably be to R. Moses ha-Kohen or another figure."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:41.893295007Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}